      "width": "full",
      "heading": "A conversation with superintelligence",
      "body": "Daedalus Alpha follows a scientist trying to speak with an apparent superintelligence and questioning what is answering. I wrote and pitched the film, then worked as producer, director, and editor, coordinating the 12-person production from planning through the shoot and final delivery.",
