      "id": "alpha-production",
      "type": "text",
      "width": "full",
      "heading": "An overnight production",
      "body": "The production involved nine crew members, including me, and three cast members. We shot from roughly 8 PM to 8 AM. I directed performances, coordinated departments, responded to practical constraints on set, and shaped the final film in the edit.",
